#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:18 c0b8daf0962e488189407b99a20966f3
msgid "Abstract base class for audio effects in the FMOD audio system."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffect**    是所有 FMOD 音频效果资源的基类。它负责把效果创建出的 DSP 应用到    ``FmodChannelGroup``   "
"，并保存当前所属总线和 DSP 链。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:23 42c6c1338ace414da2bc488ecc598a2b
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:25 ec3d6067dfc1474993e3bbf9c7b14254
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffect is the abstract base class for all audio effects in the FMOD integration. It "
"provides a common interface for applying effects to audio buses (channel groups). Subclasses "
"implement specific effect types such as Amplify, Filter, EQ, Reverb, Delay, etc."
msgstr "FmodAudioEffect 是 FMOD 音频效果器的抽象基类，提供将效果器应用到音频总线（通道组）的公共接口。子类实现增益、滤波、均衡、混响和延迟等效果。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffect.rst:27 200ef58611a646289f3110e7f1da374a
msgid ""
"The effect can be applied to a :ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` using "
":ref:`apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>` and removed using "
":ref:`remove_from_bus()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_remove_from_bus>`."
msgstr ""
"使用    :ref:`apply_to()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_apply_to>`    将效果器应用到    "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>`   ，使用    "
":ref:`remove_from_bus()<class_FmodAudioEffect_method_remove_from_bus>`    将其移除。"

